they would choose the person with the bare hands.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:27.840
So then. You understand then if someone's deranged&nbsp;
and they have psychotic ambitions to kill people,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:28.720 --> 00:01:34.240
but they can't get their hands on something that&nbsp;
does that act, killing so well, then they're not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.240 --> 00:01:41.040
