as many deaths, as much carnage. So then,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:44.960
without changing the hearts and minds of these&nbsp;
people, which we should all try to do, of course,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:45.840 --> 00:01:49.280
but without having to get into that&nbsp;
real complex topic, how do you prevent&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:49.280 --> 00:01:54.480
someone from becoming so deranged? You are&nbsp;
limiting the amount of damage they can do.&nbsp;&nbsp;

